    /**
     * Redirects the user to a target URL.
     *
     * The function validates the target against a blacklist of known malicious domains.
     *
     * @param response The {@link HttpServletResponse} object to send the redirect.
     * @param targetUrl The URL to redirect to.
     * @throws IOException If an input or output error occurs when sending the redirect.
     * @throws IllegalArgumentException If the target URL is null, empty, malformed,
     *                                  or points to a blacklisted domain.
